# Personal financial documents. A payslips folder was found sitting in the
# repo root on 2026-09-07 -- real PDFs carrying salary, NI number and address,
# untracked but one `git add -A` away from a public repository. Nothing had
# been committed. Extraction runs in the browser (REHAUL_PLAN.md 7.P), so
# these files never need to be here at all.
Income & Taxes/
*_Payslip.pdf
*_Earnings.xlsx
